<div class="faq-container">
  <h2 class="faq-header">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-question">
      <span>What is CareConnect?</span>
      <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-answer">
      CareConnect is a platform that connects NGOs, orphanages, and donors to
      facilitate donations and event management.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-question">
      <span>How can I donate?</span>
      <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-answer">
      You can donate by creating an account, selecting an NGO or event, and
      choosing your preferred donation method.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-question">
      <span>Is my donation secure?</span>
      <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-answer">
      Yes! We use secure payment gateways to ensure your donations reach the
      right people safely.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-question">
      <span>Can NGOs create fundraising campaigns?</span>
      <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-answer">
      Yes! Registered NGOs can create and manage fundraising campaigns through
      their dashboard.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-question">
      <span>How do I know if my donation has reached the beneficiary?</span>
      <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-answer">
      How do I know if my donation has reached the beneficiary? After your
      donation is processed, you will receive a confirmation email and a
      receipt. Many NGOs also provide updates, impact reports, or acknowledgment
      messages on their campaign pages. You can check your donation status in
      your Donor Dashboard.
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
      document.querySelectorAll(".faq-question").forEach((item) => {
        item.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const answer = item.nextElementSibling;
          const toggle = item.querySelector(".faq-toggle");

          if (answer.style.display === "block") {
            answer.style.display = "none";
            toggle.textContent = "+";
          } else {
            answer.style.display = "block";
            toggle.textContent = "-";
          }
        });
      });
    </script>
</div>
